This is a call out to those of you that came along to a Bassidi Kone workshop and/or event[![bassidi 3](/media/2014/07/bassidi-3.jpg)](/media/2014/07/bassidi-3.jpg) throughout the Bassidi Kone World Music Tour. Bassidi and Freya would love some feedback on how you found the workshops and would appreciate any testimonials that you feel you could contribute to their new website which goes LIVE this week. We have a Bassidi Kone Express CD to be won, which was a 2014 music project in Melbourne that Bassidi and well known local jazz musicians of Melbourne created prior to Bassidi arriving on the Sunshine Coast.  This project was funded by the Australian government.  So, to win this CD please submit your testimonial/feedback to info@rhythmculture.com.au
